</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord of power, with power divine,</l><l>Cleanse this guilty heart of mine;</l><l>Long has sin without control</l><l>Held dominion o’er my soul.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord of joy, with joy divine,</l><l>Cheer this saddened heart of mine;</l><l>Bid my many woes depart,</l><l>Heal my wounded, bleeding heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, the Spirit, all divine,</l><l>Dwell within this heart of mine;</l><l>Cast down every idol throne,</l><l>Reign supreme, and reign alone.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
